{"version":1,"key":"card:596","content":{"id":596,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Host 请求头是为了解决在同一个服务器上托管多个服务的问题，这些服务共享同一个 IP 地址（多个域名对应一个 IP 地址），为了确定使用哪个托管的服务提供应答，Host 请求头部应运而生。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Host 请求头部的语法："}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"Host: <host>[\":\"<port>]","language":"HTTP","uuid":"85a2db76-31ef-45cb-adff-e4be8789b65e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"<host>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是主机名（域名或 IP 地址）"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"[\":\"<port>]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是可选的端口，一般当端口不是默认端口（80 或 443）的时候才需要单独指定"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"客户端如何构建 Host 头部："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"确认主机名，从客户端提供的 URL 中解析出域名部分"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"确认端口"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"没有手定指定端口"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"协议是 HTTP，默认端口为 80"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"协议是 HTTPS，默认端口为 443"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"指定了端口，则提取该端口号"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"HTTP/1.1 要求必须发送 Host 请求头，当没有发送 Host 请求头并且服务器需要知道根据 Host 来区分不同服务时，就会返回 400 Bad Request。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《HTTP 权威指南》，第 18 章，Web 主机托管"}]}]}]}],"tags":["HTTP/Host"],"createTime":1752889979625,"updateTime":1754150628260,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1754150628260}}